1. Paste the word into the shared dictionary text file. Each entry in the dictionary should be on a new line. *- yellow rectangle*

> In the image below you can see the shared dictionary text file open in the **VS Code text editor**. *- red rectangle*

> Its location is shown in the breadcrumbs. *- orange rectangle*

3. Save the file.

> The flagging then disappears from the the word in the text.

